 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. Er, it's a bit embarrassing, so it is. There's been blood on the toilet paper."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You're not the first, and you're right to come. How long has that been happening?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About a week, I'd say. Every time I go, nearly. Bright red, on the paper. Not in the pan, mind."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And is it mixed in with the stool, or only on the paper?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just on the paper, after I wipe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain when you go?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit of a sting, yes. And an itch around there, which is awful."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you constipated, or straining?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I do strain, if I'm honest. I have the sort of stools that don't want to leave."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any change in how often you go, or in the stool, black, loose, or anything unusual?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, it's much the same as always, hard and slow."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's your diet like?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Terrible. Takeaways, mostly. Hardly any veg. My mother would be mortified."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm at a desk all day, I do the accounts for a haulage firm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any past operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A hernia repair, years ago, on the right. Ten years, maybe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse and pressure first. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 70, blood pressure 130 over 80.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Now, from what you describe, bright red blood only on the paper, a sting and itch, and hard stools, this sounds like haemorrhoids, piles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Piles! My granda had those. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very common. But at your age, I'd like to be sure, so I'd like to arrange a proctoscopy, a short look inside with a small tube."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, God. Is that sore? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's uncomfortable, not painful, and it takes a minute. The nurse will book you in this week. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. Right, if I must. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In the meantime, have more fibre, fruit and veg, and drink lots of water, so the stools soften."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can do an apple. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "An apple is a start. Don't strain, and don't sit on the toilet scrolling your phone. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How did you know? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Everyone does it. Come back and see me in two weeks, once you've had the proctoscopy, to go over it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. Thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
